{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"斯洛伐克","country_iso":"SVK","created_at":"2026-07-02T13:17:34.969819","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"SVK-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":"","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"斯洛伐克6.6MW/13.2MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Slovakia 6.6MW/13.2MWh Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"派能科技","content":"近日，派能科技位于斯洛伐克工业园区的储能项目成功并网，随即投入运营，并启动扩容建设。该项目总容量为6.6MW/13.2MWh，配备四台L3300-OMNI 液冷储能集装箱系统。从项目规划至并网投产历时仅六个月，该项目树立了区域绿色能源基础设施高效建设的新标杆。\n该项目投运即启动扩容，充分印证了派能科技储能方案在实际电网环境中的灵活性。L3300-OMNI储能系统通过液冷温控与多重安全防护等技术，实现精准的电芯温差控制及高效的系统充放电效率、长循环寿命，确保储能系统在复杂工况下保持卓越性能。\n项目的成功投运，印证了派能科技的技术实力与运营能力，显著增强了本地合作伙伴与工业用户对资产安全及长期运营的信心。派能科技将持续以安全可靠的储能解决方案，携手产业链上下游合作伙伴，推动能源结构转型，共创可持续的能源未来。","content_sha256":"c4da7ef1655d9d4bfd90a48b9bbb9d8c9161bbb77f5c916bc8672ea7a79fe7ba","id":26978,"publish_date":"2026-06-12 15:21:02","title":"斯洛伐克6.6MW/13.2MWh储能项目成功并网，派能科技高效交付再获认可","title_sha256":"bae6b4660b7b57e2016202fffc41b22be445a4a96d2693909fd1e8d4f0bd6443","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/95628.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"SVK-ES-0001","capacity_details":"13.2MWh","capacity_mw":6.6,"capacity_mw_raw":"6.6","capacity_source":"original","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:17:34.978665","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"SVK-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"派能科技","project_developer_en":"Sicon Corporation","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"中国企业派能科技在斯洛伐克参与了一个6.6MW/13.2MWh的储能项目，项目已投入运营，派能科技作为设备供应商提供液冷储能集装